        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Read the scope of both negatives",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Work out what each negative applies to. A double negative can affirm a limited point without proving every stronger claim.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我不是没看见，只是没看清楚。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ bùshì méi kànjiàn ， zhǐshì méi kàn qīngchu 。",
                "meaning": "It is not that I saw nothing; I just did not see clearly.",
                "audio": "ba96afb7e9e91857a7066ff974425738949f298b6b4585f83638e1c9d94f4ef6"
              }
            ]
          },
